      "settings": {
        "title": "Bringing Your Vision to Life",
        "heading_size": "heading-standard",
        "rich_text": "<h4><strong>Experience the artistry and precision of our screen printing services at Designer T's.</strong></h4><p>At Designer T's, we elevate screen printing to an art form. With decades of experience and a commitment to excellence, we deliver vibrant, long-lasting prints that truly make your brand stand out. Our state-of-the-art facility houses a fleet of advanced automatic screen printing machines, ensuring consistent quality, unparalleled efficiency, and rapid turnaround times. This cutting-edge technology, combined with the expertise of our skilled artisans, allows us to bring your creative vision to life with exceptional precision and speed.<br/><br/>We utilize a diverse range of high-quality, carefully selected plastisol ink to achieve the desired opacity and look without sacrificing  feel. Whether you're seeking the vibrant intensity, or the unique vintage effect of discharge printing, we have the expertise and the resources to deliver exceptional results.<br/><br/><strong>Soft-hand Printing:</strong> Experience unparalleled comfort and a luxurious feel with our soft-hand printing techniques.<br/><br/><strong>Simulated Process Printing:</strong> Achieve stunning photorealistic effects with our meticulous simulated process printing capabilities.</p>",
        "display_on_card": false,
        "content_width_desktop": "lg:w-full",
